cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "sym2quantized-sapt"
abstract: >-
  A SymPy-based package for second-quantized operator algebra in Symmetry-Adapted
  Perturbation Theory (SAPT), extending SymPy's second-quantization module with a
  generalized Wick's theorem for the product of two Fermi vacuums.
type: software
authors:
